<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 24.7.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 24.7.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 30,500 shares in Polish food trader Rolimpex SA at 24.7 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Thursday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Rolimpex traded at 24.2 zlotys in a volume of 4,243 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
